pponents cast that target this creature cost {2} more to cast.\"","power":"2","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2019-07-12","toughness":"2","type_line":"Creature \u2014 Human"},{"cmc":3.0,"color_identity":["U"],"colors":[],"defense":null,"faces":[],"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{0}","mana_value":0,"name":"Generic Blue Pulse","oracle_id":"fixture:grant-blue-pulse","oracle_text":"Add {U}.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2019-07-12","toughness":null,"type_line":"Instant"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"The decision whether or not to tap or untap is made on resolution. This is not a modal spell.","oracle_id":"773ad2ef-5acc-49ea-8d85-056330e87039","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This is not a toggle effect. If you use Twiddle to tap a card and before it takes effect your opponent taps it, Twiddle will not automatically untap the card.","oracle_id":"773ad2ef-5acc-49ea-8d85-056330e87039","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"An opponent\u2019s spell that targets a single creature with flying you control more than once costs only {2} more to cast. An opponent\u2019s spell that targets multiple creatures with flying you control costs {2} more for each of those creatures.","oracle_id":"aab55af7-8084-47b6-910f-75a75a6313a4","published_at":"2020-04-17","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Jubilant Skybonder\u2019s last ability applies to itself as long as it still has flying.","oracle_id":"aab55af7-8084-47b6-910f-75a75a6313a4","published_at":"2020-04-17","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Effects that modify a creature\u2019s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Seal of Strength, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.","oracle_id":"d2d41f12-18d8-473b-9308-3f02d7d791f0","published_at":"2016-06-08","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Humble doesn\u2019t counter abilities that have already triggered or been activated. In particular, casting this spell won\u2019t stop a creature\u2019s ability that says \u201cAt the beginning of your upkeep,\u201d \u201cWhen this creature enters the battlefield,\u201d or similar from triggering.","oracle_id":"d2d41f12-18d8-473b-9308-3f02d7d791f0","published_at":"2016-06-08","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Humble overwrites all previous effects that set the creature\u2019s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Humble resolves will overwrite this effect.","oracle_id":"d2d41f12-18d8-473b-9308-3f02d7d791f0","published_at":"2016-06-08","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the affected creature gains an ability after Humble resolves, it will keep that ability.","oracle_id":"d2d41f12-18d8-473b-9308-3f02d7d791f0","published_at":"2016-06-08","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You may choose the same creature for both targets since the card says \"target creature\" multiple times. You may also choose two different creatures.","oracle_id":"e8aa12f8-8922-41ed-8cdb-219c9e4b9e36","published_at":"2013-01-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"To work as an evasion ability, an attacking creature must already have flying when the declare blockers step begins. Once a creature has become blocked, giving it flying won\u2019t change that.","oracle_id":"f7518456-45ed-41d4-bd3c-5aacea28eb35","published_at":"2009-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"An opponent\u2019s spell that targets a single creature or enchantment you control more than once costs only {1} more to cast. An opponent\u2019s spell that targets multiple creatures and/or enchantments you control costs {1} more for each of them.","oracle_id":"faf081dc-1fb2-47ac-a9c7-8001b4904120","published_at":"2020-01-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Callaphe\u2019s last ability applies to itself as well as other creatures and enchantments you control.","oracle_id":"faf081dc-1fb2-47ac-a9c7-8001b4904120","published_at":"2020-01-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Callaphe\u2019s last ability gives only one instance of the ability to creatures you control that are also enchantments.","oracle_id":"faf081dc-1fb2-47ac-a9c7-8001b4904120","published_at":"2020-01-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don\u2019t count toward your devotion to any color.","oracle_id":"faf081dc-1fb2-47ac-a9c7-8001b4904120","published_at":"2020-01-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).","oracle_id":"faf081dc-1fb2-47ac-a9c7-8001b4904120","published_at":"2020-01-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it\u2019s still on the battlefield at that time.","oracle_id":"faf081dc-1fb2-47ac-a9c7-8001b4904120","published_at":"2020-01-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you put an Aura on an opponent\u2019s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.","oracle_id":"faf081dc-1fb2-47ac-a9c7-8001b4904120","published_at":"2020-01-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don\u2019t count toward your devotion to any color.","oracle_id":"faf081dc-1fb2-47ac-a9c7-8001b4904120","published_at":"2020-01-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The ability that defines Callaphe\u2019s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield.","oracle_id":"faf081dc-1fb2-47ac-a9c7-8001b4904120","published_at":"2020-01-24","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Pinned original grant-cost/ruling witnesses plus normal compiler-admitted role/condition/mana controls"}
